{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore"]]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/reconcile(with:preserving:removingMissing:)"},"abstract":[{"text":"Reconciles this store against an authoritative snapshot from storage.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reconcile"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"with"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"remote"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore","text":"EntityStore","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"preserving"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"removingMissing"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The rows read from storage."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"remote"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"IDs the caller knows carry unflushed local intent — a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"drained-but-unflushed write, a write whose save failed, or a pending"},{"type":"text","text":